  "goodToKnow": "Die Volksabstimmung is a referendum. The Grundgesetz provides for national referendums only in very specific cases (like reorganising state borders), partly because of experiences in the Weimar Republic. At state and local level, Volksbegehren and Volksentscheide are common: in 2021, Berliners voted to expropriate large housing companies (not yet implemented). Switzerland is famous for direct democracy. Plural: die Volksabstimmungen."
